			title: "Two Needles"
			description: ["Craft Nature's Compass and Explorer's Compass.", "", "Nature's: a compass ringed with logs and saplings. Explorer's: a compass", "ringed with cracked stone bricks and cobwebs. Right-click either, search", "a biome or structure by name, pick it, and the needle points at it with a", "distance. The radius is finite -- if it finds nothing, travel and retry."]
